message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below, and cite Lavi's preprint for the mathematics."
type: software
title: "Lean 4 formalization of Lavi's proof of Foregger's conjecture, conditional on Gurvits's capacity inequality"
version: 1.2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24254583
date-released: 2026-11-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/tommac/lavi-section2-lean"
